#VAR(Table, TABLE)
#ADDTBL("../encoding.tbl", Table)
#ACTIVETBL(Table)
#VAR(PTR, CUSTOMPOINTER)
#CREATEPTR(PTR, "LINEAR", 0, 16)
#JMP($0000097A)

#WRITE(PTR, $00000500)
【あやせ？】
“Fly and cross, fly and cross... And now, the promise...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000510)
【あやせ？】
“Fly and cross, fly and cross... Fulfilled in all its glory...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000520)
【あやせ？】
“Fly and cross, fly and cross... It unleashes the one and only...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000530)
【あやせ？】
“Fly and cross, fly and cross... Ending of everything...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000540)
Late into the night, the sound of a beautiful voice could be heard%Nthroughout Miyashita Park.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000006B0)
It was coming from a pedestrian bridge that crossed over%NMeiji-dori.
<LINE>
A steady flow of cars passed underneath.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000006C0)
But in spite of this, the girl known as “FES” showed no sign of%Nbeing affected by the noise. She simply kept on singing, leaning%Nback against the handrail of the bridge.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000726)
【あやせ２】
“O servant, revealed by the light of the moonlit night...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000736)
On any normal day, if she were to sing on the street in public like this, she would surely attract hundreds of onlookers.
<LINE>
But right now, nobody was listening to her sing.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00000746)
For FES was deliberately concealing her presence—blending into%Nthe stillness of the night.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000007EC)
【あやせ２】
“Connect the phantasmal paths which lead to this place...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000007FC)
This way, she could loiter quietly until the moon left the sky%Nbehind.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000080C)
By doing so—by becoming one with the darkness—she felt as if she%Ncould free herself from the corrupt atmosphere of Shibuya, if only%Nfor a moment.
<LINE>
That was what FES felt to be true.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000081C)
【あやせ２】
“Little do they know, their screams will soon turn to silence...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000008BC)
Suddenly, FES looked up to the night sky.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000008CC)
The clouds covering it were starting to clear up, little by little, leaving space for the moonlight to shine through in their wake.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000008DC)
But sadly, any and all starlight was completely drowned out by the%Ndazzling neon of Shibuya.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000008EC)
【あやせ２】
“And repose shall fall upon us as we link hand in hand within the%Nwind...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000008FC)
FES halted her song, then slowly reached her hand out toward the%Nsky.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $0000090C)
【あやせ２】
“Whose eyes are those eyes?”
<END>
瑞
